---
---

<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-100 via-stone-50 to-amber-50/40 dark:from-stone-900 dark:via-stone-900 dark:to-stone-950 pt-12 pb-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        <span class="inline-block bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/50 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Marca Marys Arts
        </span>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Cada rincón de tu hogar <br />
          <span class="text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-400 italic">merece una historia.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
          Descubre piezas de resina pintadas completamente a mano que llenan tu hogar de calidez, elegancia y personalidad.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start pt-2">
          <a href="#colecciones" class="bg-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-900 text-white font-medium text-base px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-all text-center">
            Comprar colección
          </a>
          <a href="/catalogo" class="bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-300 text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 font-medium text-base px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl transition-all text-center">
            Ver catálogo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white dark:border-stone-800">
          <img
            src="/images/gallery/taller-1.jpg"
            alt="Mujer decorando su sala con piezas artesanales"
            class="w-full h-[450px] object-cover"
            loading="eager"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-white/90 dark:bg-stone-900/90 backdrop-blur-md p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800">
            <p class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">"Llena cada espacio con serenidad y detalles únicos."</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
